> to Digital Unix (osf). I have edited the necessary files (/.rhosts,
> /etc/hosts.equiv, /etc/securetty) in the Digital machine so that the Sun

The file is /etc/securettys and it should have:

/dev/console
local:0
:0
ptys

The last line allows psudo-terminals (network) to log in root.

Nix.



